# Old Wix addresses → their place on this site. Cloudflare Pages reads this
# file; it is not served as a page. Keep it in step with the redirect map in
# docs/information-architecture.md, and see MAINTENANCE.md → "Adding a redirect".
#
# One rule per line: old-address new-address 301
#   - Always write 301. With no code Cloudflare sends a temporary 302.
#   - A line Cloudflare can't read is skipped without any error, which is why
#     tests/redirects.test.mjs checks every line.
#   - /about and /contact need no rule: Cloudflare already sends /about to
#     /about/ once that page exists, and a rule for it could loop.
#   - Fixed addresses first, wildcards (*) last.
# Rules: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

